{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-06",
  "title": "Broken Strings",
  "storyCode": "6-7",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ef2fed17c0a73ebfce86103e9ae421100de133787f5619bccc982d6df75cbbe0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "GreyThroat! What's your position?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Amiya, I am providing support to an L. G. D. team.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We're about to engage!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Attention all elite operators: this may be our first, last, and only large-scale battle in Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Everyone take objective one as your primary mission.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "My team and I will be focusing on engaging the enemy commander.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I want you all to remember: top priority is completing the terms of our contract, that is to work with the L. G. D. to ensure the security of Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But Rhodes Island's mission in this battle is to reduce the friction between the Infected and uninfected people, to prevent clashes!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We are Rhodes Island! No matter what else we carry into battle!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No matter when, no matter where!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "And of course, if at any point our operations fall outside our standards, we will put a stop to them at once!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "As such, we go into battle with a heavy burden of responsibility on our shoulders.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "That was for my sake, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "She's such a worrywart...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We'd better speed up, or we won't make it.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "You saw what tough customers those Infected were back there. That's a lot for one operator, or even one team to handle.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "I really should've put that kid to bed once and for all back on the rooftop.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Oh, copy.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "If you don't get your butt to the ambush point, I'll take all of last year's disciplinary reports and hand them over to Dr. Kal'tsit!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Settle down! I'll be there right on time!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Amiya! She's scratching my coat!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Blaze!",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "What am I supposed to do? We have to hurry...",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "(You'll pay for that one!)",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Why so quiet, Doctor?",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "......Blaze!",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "I didn't do anything! It's the Doctor who clammed up!",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "Tell her already!",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "Come on, say something...!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Could you put me down when you take a call?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Huh...?",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Sorry, Doctor. I forgot you and Blaze would definitely go at it like this...",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "I do what I gotta do.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Why are you so pleased with yourself?",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Anyway, all I need is your location and current operation.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You two seem to be getting along.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Sure are!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...Really?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "(Wait, what's happening here? What should I tell her?)",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(I don't know.)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "(Say nothing.)",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "(I'm not sure.)",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "(This is bad! Red alert! I'm taking psychic damage! I need guidance!)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Keep at it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "She hung up!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Oh no. We're in trouble.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "But at least we're here. Let's take a load off.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But this is the highest point in the district?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Well... shit.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "You know what they say, the shortest distance between two points is a straight line. Let's hop down.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Hop? From this high?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Yep. Yawn.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Hold on... If I'm not mistaken... That's Mephisto's team over there to the east, moving to the ambush zone.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "And over there... the scaly kid?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "He's taking his team to fight something. What is all that black there?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Is that the herd...? With those numbers?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Looks like we can't rest here, Doctor. Let's go. Time for the final battle!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Hey, Amiya. Hey!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "I'm taking the Doctor into the fight!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "What are you thinking?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "We let a small Reunion group go, then we track them into the slums.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "Weren't you leaving that to the special forces?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "No reason we can't take the opportunity.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "I've already looked into the situation once and one thing is clear: as long as we're there, the special forces can't act openly.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Once the fighting stops, they won't be able to do much.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "You're not worried about orders from the top?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Who's going to stand up and take responsibility for the team?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "All right, so you've got it all figured out. What's going on in the slums?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "My informants have been busy. There's a few sectors I haven't been able to contact, but we have a lot more intelligence than anyone else.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "This is a big gamble. But I guess we have no choice.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "The L. G. D. is the only group that can face down the special forces.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Amiya, do you copy?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Officer Ch'en, we're in position!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "...Mmhm.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "I need to apologize for the whole ordeal with Reunion scooping up the Infected. That wouldn't have happened if we'd been more thoughtful.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...It's thanks to the L. G. D.'s quick action in the slums that Lungmen is able to plan against Reunion.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "On a strategic level, I think you're fine, Officer Ch'en. But personally...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Officer Ch'en, Misha is dead.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "And I can't condone your opinions of the Infected. Even you know...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The Lungmenites who love their city will fight for her, no matter who they are.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "Wow, what an awesome little bunny.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Did I just hear Miss Swire?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Don't mind her.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "text": "Hey!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "I agree with you, Amiya. Fighting for Lungmen can unite the people... except those tied up with Reunion.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "But actually living in Lungmen is another matter. Time can't solve everything.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Of course. We have to solve everything ourselves.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Wishful thinking. The Infected and uninfected live in different worlds.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "It's not wishful thinking, Officer Ch'en. It's thinking about Misha, and the countless other Infected who died just like her.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "It was the gap between those two worlds that killed them. Are we going to let that divide define us? Are we not going to fight to bridge it?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I hope you can understand, Officer Ch'en, why it is that the Infected and uninfected of Rhodes Island come together to fight for Lungmen.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "They're here, Officer Ch'en.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Prepare for battle.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "It's an ambush! The L. G. D. is pushing us in!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Push through to the slums. Even though we haven't heard from Crownslayer... the slums are our only way out.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Take him.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "What are you going to do?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Me and a few teams have encouraged the 'herd' to gather up here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "They won't attack me, so I can fight alongside them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "text": "Fire in the hole!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "text": "We can't hold for long!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herd",
          "text": "Ugh... Guhhh!!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "text": "It's those special Infected! Look out!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "You'll bring up the rear?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "You're not coming back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "Mmm! Mmhhh!!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Let him speak. He can't do his Arts like this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "What are you doing?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Mephisto...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "What are you doing?! You can't do this! Come back! Please! Come back here!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "You once told me you would do anything I asked you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "Sasha!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "You said you don't want to make decisions for yourself.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "It's just, if you have your own ideas and your own goals now... I can't blame you for your choices.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "If that's the way it is, Mephisto... Well, that's great.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "But...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "I'm out of options.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "So let me tell you my last wish.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "Sasha...? What are you talking about? I don't understand!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "text": "Don't let them escape! Take out their commanders!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "text": "Ah...!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "...The Rhodes Island swallow?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "(Mouthing 'pull the trigger.')",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "text": "Hit the deck! Watch the crossfire! We've got them surrounded!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "text": "——!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "text": "Fall back, Rhodes Island crossbowman! This corridor is ours!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "Faust! Run!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "No.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Crossbowmen, I know FrostNova is on her way. And even though Crownslayer is missing, her people are out there in the slums somewhere.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "When FrostNova gets here, you're under her command.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "I trust her. Once she arrives, you'll be okay.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "And with my Originium Arts, you'll be invisible.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "You can't, Faust! That will rupture your organs!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Doesn't matter. There's no reason not to do it anymore.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Retreat. That's an order.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "And take him with you. But not to Chernobog.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "text": "...Faust...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "You can't do this!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "I hope you survive. Even on your own.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Don't die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "——That's my last wish.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "Sasha! Sashaaaaa!!!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "I don't want to hurt anyone. I don't want to get anyone hurt.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "I wish we had just run away, back then.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "We could have... just run away.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "Sasha, you promised! We promised each other! We swore we would survive together!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "It's too late... for me...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "...I'm too tired.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "text": "Sashaaaaaa!!!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Faust",
          "text": "Goodbye, Eno.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "He nocks a bolt into his crossbow, and winds it.\nHe takes aim, for the last time."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
